{"id":"caaaa328dfa0f547","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-priority-true-path.md","title":"Stage Paths and True-Path Conditions","display":"df-priority-true-path — Stage Paths and True-Path Conditions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-priority-true-path","aliases":["68-df-priority-true-path","68-BC-sacks-priority-method"],"display":"df-priority-true-path — Stage Paths and True-Path Conditions","depends_on":["[[68-df-recursive-tree]]","[[68-df-requirement-satisfaction]]"],"source_location":"local true-path conditions in supplied archive; no method theorem asserted","verification_status":"local-definition-reviewed","source_proof_status":"not-a-method-theorem","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_basis":"supplied-68(2).zip; local scope, domain, and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-priority-true-path"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-priority-true-path</span><span>68-BC-sacks-priority-method</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-priority-true-path — Stage Paths and True-Path Conditions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7e933c06a0edd826\" href=\"?note=7e933c06a0edd826\" title=\"68-df-recursive-tree\">68-df-recursive-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2e6c7ec5afeb5526\" href=\"?note=2e6c7ec5afeb5526\" title=\"68-df-requirement-satisfaction\">68-df-requirement-satisfaction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"local true-path conditions in supplied archive; no method theorem asserted"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-definition-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-a-method-theorem"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68(2).zip; local scope, domain, and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec f=(f_s)_{s\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\vec f=(f_s)_{s\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(f\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathcal P(\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N})^T\">\\(R\\in\\mathcal P(\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N})^T\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sqsubseteq\">\\(\\sqsubseteq\\)</span>、有限序列长度见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7e933c06a0edd826\" href=\"?note=7e933c06a0edd826\" title=\"68-df-recursive-tree\">68-df-recursive-tree</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2e6c7ec5afeb5526\" href=\"?note=2e6c7ec5afeb5526\" title=\"68-df-requirement-satisfaction\">68-df-requirement-satisfaction</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}\">\\(&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}\\)</span> 在此只表示左侧分歧关系，不包含真前缀比较。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StagePath}_{68}\">\\(\\operatorname{StagePath}_{68}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TruePath}\">\\(\\mathrm{TruePath}\\)</span> 和保留旧符号的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SacksGoal}\">\\(\\mathrm{SacksGoal}\\)</span> 在下式定义；它们分别表示合法阶段路径数据、访问条件和路径要求的验收条件，不表示构造存在性定理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}\\sigma\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists i&lt;\\min(\\operatorname{lh}(\\tau),\\operatorname{lh}(\\sigma))\\;\n\\bigl(\\tau\\upharpoonright i=\\sigma\\upharpoonright i\\land\\tau(i)=0\\land\\sigma(i)=1\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}\\sigma\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists i&lt;\\min(\\operatorname{lh}(\\tau),\\operatorname{lh}(\\sigma))\\;\n\\bigl(\\tau\\upharpoonright i=\\sigma\\upharpoonright i\\land\\tau(i)=0\\land\\sigma(i)=1\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StagePath}_{68}(T,\\vec f)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\nT\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall\\sigma\\in T\\;\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}\\;(\\tau\\sqsubseteq\\sigma\\Longrightarrow\\tau\\in T)\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(f_s\\in T\\land\\operatorname{lh}(f_s)=s)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{StagePath}_{68}(T,\\vec f)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\nT\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall\\sigma\\in T\\;\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}\\;(\\tau\\sqsubseteq\\sigma\\Longrightarrow\\tau\\in T)\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(f_s\\in T\\land\\operatorname{lh}(f_s)=s)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"O_{\\vec f,\\sigma}:=\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:\\sigma\\sqsubseteq f_s\\},\\qquad\nL_{\\vec f,\\sigma}:=\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:f_s&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}\\sigma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[O_{\\vec f,\\sigma}:=\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:\\sigma\\sqsubseteq f_s\\},\\qquad\nL_{\\vec f,\\sigma}:=\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:f_s&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}\\sigma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TruePath}(\\vec f,f)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(|O_{\\vec f,f\\upharpoonright n}|=\\aleph_0\\land|L_{\\vec f,f\\upharpoonright n}|&lt;\\aleph_0\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{TruePath}(\\vec f,f)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(|O_{\\vec f,f\\upharpoonright n}|=\\aleph_0\\land|L_{\\vec f,f\\upharpoonright n}|&lt;\\aleph_0\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SacksGoal}(T,R,\\vec f,f)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\operatorname{StagePath}_{68}(T,\\vec f)\\land\\mathrm{TruePath}(\\vec f,f)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists S\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}\\;\n(f\\upharpoonright n\\in T\\land(f\\upharpoonright n,S)\\in R\\land\n\\mathrm{Sat}(\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N},S,f))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SacksGoal}(T,R,\\vec f,f)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\operatorname{StagePath}_{68}(T,\\vec f)\\land\\mathrm{TruePath}(\\vec f,f)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists S\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}\\;\n(f\\upharpoonright n\\in T\\land(f\\upharpoonright n,S)\\in R\\land\n\\mathrm{Sat}(\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N},S,f))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原文件实际只定义 TruePath 与 SacksGoal，却用 sacks-priority-method 命名。本次按其数学内容改为真路径条件定义，保留原谓词名和旧文件名别名，不把验收谓词改称一般方法定理。</p>\n<p>原 Hypothesis 中的树非空、前缀闭合及每阶段长度条件现由 StagePath 明确表达。在原先满足这些条件的输入上，新 SacksGoal 与原式完全相同。TruePath 的两项分别约束无限访问和有限左侧访问；它没有把有限字符串的 liminf 当作未定义原语。</p>\n<p>此定义不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 递归，也未断言任意要求族可实现。取某个路径上的要求为空集即可使 SacksGoal 失败，所以不能由这些定义推出一个无条件的 Sacks 构造定理。文件仅承载上传材料已有的路径接口，不增加外部策略理论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-recursive-tree","status":"resolved","id":"7e933c06a0edd826","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-requirement-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"2e6c7ec5afeb5526","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-requirement-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-tree","status":"resolved","id":"7e933c06a0edd826","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}$，$\\vec f=(f_s)_{s\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}^{\\mathbb N}$，$f\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}$，$R\\in\\mathcal P(\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N})^T$。$\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}$、$\\sqsubseteq$、有限序列长度见 [[68-df-recursive-tree]]；$\\mathrm{Sat}$ 见 [[68-df-requirement-satisfaction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-requirement-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"2e6c7ec5afeb5526","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}$，$\\vec f=(f_s)_{s\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}^{\\mathbb N}$，$f\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}$，$R\\in\\mathcal P(\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N})^T$。$\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}$、$\\sqsubseteq$、有限序列长度见 [[68-df-recursive-tree]]；$\\mathrm{Sat}$ 见 [[68-df-requirement-satisfaction]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec f=(f_s)_{s\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in\\mathcal P(\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N})^T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sqsubseteq","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}","display":false},{"tex":"<_{\\mathrm{lex}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{StagePath}_{68}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TruePath}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SacksGoal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau<_{\\mathrm{lex}}\\sigma\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists i<\\min(\\operatorname{lh}(\\tau),\\operatorname{lh}(\\sigma))\\;\n\\bigl(\\tau\\upharpoonright i=\\sigma\\upharpoonright i\\land\\tau(i)=0\\land\\sigma(i)=1\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{StagePath}_{68}(T,\\vec f)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\nT\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall\\sigma\\in T\\;\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}\\;(\\tau\\sqsubseteq\\sigma\\Longrightarrow\\tau\\in T)\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(f_s\\in T\\land\\operatorname{lh}(f_s)=s)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"O_{\\vec f,\\sigma}:=\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:\\sigma\\sqsubseteq f_s\\},\\qquad\nL_{\\vec f,\\sigma}:=\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:f_s<_{\\mathrm{lex}}\\sigma\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TruePath}(\\vec f,f)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(|O_{\\vec f,f\\upharpoonright n}|=\\aleph_0\\land|L_{\\vec f,f\\upharpoonright n}|<\\aleph_0\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SacksGoal}(T,R,\\vec f,f)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\operatorname{StagePath}_{68}(T,\\vec f)\\land\\mathrm{TruePath}(\\vec f,f)\\land\n\\bigl(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists S\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}\\;\n(f\\upharpoonright n\\in T\\land(f\\upharpoonright n,S)\\in R\\land\n\\mathrm{Sat}(\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N},S,f))\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":3380,"backlinks":[{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-57","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[68-df-priority-true-path]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-66","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-priority-true-path]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[68-df-minimal-degree-tree]] 保留树验收定义；[[68-prop-minimal-degree-tree-characterization]] 只展开该定义，不构造见证。[[68-df-priority-true-path]] 按其实际内容归为阶段路径和真路径条件的定义，不作为方法存在性定理；[[68-df-fixed-marker-coding]] 与 [[68-df-finite-use-preservation]] 只提供各自明示的局部接口，不宣称完整 Sacks 策略。"}],"outgoing":["7e933c06a0edd826","2e6c7ec5afeb5526"]}